! Art Gallery Plugin

Display art in responsive layouts with fullscreen lightbox viewing.

!! Usage

Create gallery tiddlers with the `Gallery` tag and these fields:

* `image` - Image URL
* `video` - Video URL (alternative to image)
* `title` - Artwork title
* `notes` - Artist notes or description
* `tags` - Additional tags for filtering

!! Widget Syntax

Masonry layout (default):

```
<$gallery filter="[tag[Gallery]]" />
```

Grid layout:

```
<$gallery filter="[tag[Gallery]]" layout="grid" />
```

Carousel layout:

```
<$gallery filter="[tag[Gallery]]" layout="carousel" />
```

Filter by tags:

```
<$gallery filter="[tag[Gallery]tag[fractal]]" />
```

!! Features

* Responsive masonry, grid, and carousel layouts
* Fullscreen lightbox with smooth fade transitions
* Support for images and videos
* Hover effects and smooth animations
* Keyboard navigation (Escape to close)


